      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Simplify the expression $-5-(2t-1).$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we remove the parentheses by distributing the negative sign. This gives\n\n$$\n-5-2t+1\n$$\n\nFinally, we collect like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5-2t+1 & = \\\\ (-5+1)-2t & = \\\\ -4-2t & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
